      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#xA;    class=&#34;my-0 rounded-md&#34;&#xA;    loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;    decoding=&#34;async&#34;&#xA;    fetchpriority=&#34;auto&#34;&#xA;    alt=&#34;LLM costs: tokens rising, drowning in costs&#34;&#xA;    width=&#34;720&#34;&#xA;    height=&#34;220&#34;&#xA;    src=&#34;https://thayer-blog.b2si.com/images/llm-costs-dam-picture.png&#34;&#xA;    srcset=&#34;https://thayer-blog.b2si.com/images/llm-costs-dam-picture.png 800w, https://thayer-blog.b2si.com/images/llm-costs-dam-picture.png 1280w&#34;&#xA;    sizes=&#34;(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 65vw&#34;&#xA;    data-zoom-src=&#34;https://thayer-blog.b2si.com/images/llm-costs-dam-picture.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;See also: &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.reddit.com/r/LLMDevs/comments/1njmjsn/what_do_you_do_about_llm_token_costs/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;What do you do about LLM token costs?&lt;/a&gt; for some great discussions.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;m an AI software engineer doing consulting and startup work. Mostly I work on agents and RAG systems. I generally don&amp;rsquo;t pay too much attention to costs but, as my clients grow and my agents are proliferate, API and inference costs are getting more expensive.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
